b1394acaebf5528c4e1e1b05b07b5595540a59cecc26fe1d2b416e86bb","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":22},{"dia_id":"D30:23","global_turn_index":567,"locator":"[S30T23]","raw_turn_sha256":"0f17909f7891ef203e064ef591f394e3e5b96d70aeadb8f7d55c628c6df07102","rendered_turn_sha256":"bf28ba0e7922ec9a4d4b50fa25d4d6e38c934ecbb7da8c2635c73bc4e0aae415","session_date":"2023-11-17","session_datetime":"2023-11-17T10:54:00","session_id":"session_30","session_index":30,"source_sha256":"a7049ac013bc5da25c55f6a2fbbd8d1b565ea00110f0d78775080fd6e87daf57","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":23},{"dia_id":"D30:24","global_turn_index":568,"locator":"[S30T24]","raw_turn_sha256":"aabba3ecc9ff029935e35534c34ed3b9f0ff69f1fc23d0909f17b30e198c8960","rendered_turn_sha256":"19aae2d71e03f50be2694151f2a92628102b5bc0a3cabd585551052a99b7d2a2","session_date":"2023-11-17","session_datetime":"2023-11-17T10:54:00","session_id":"session_30","session_index":30,"source_sha256":"b1112e12756742bd43795fac70cd818da829d92b77e29af173be10fcdbe7919f","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":24}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-11-17, reconnected with Calvin (\"Hey Calvin, long time no talk!\"): Calvin told him he went to a \"fancy gala\" in Boston the day before (2023-11-16) and met some interesting people, and shared a pic of himself and \"the crew\" (a photography of a group of men sitting on a rock next to a river; Calvin's side in the Boston trip section of /memories/calvin.md); Dave: \"Calvin, that event looks amazing! You all look awesome. Who did you have the most interesting chat with?\" (Dave's message also carried a photo of a boat floating in the water at sunset) [S30T1][S30T2][S30T3]. Calvin: he had a really interesting chat with \"this cool artist\" — they clicked over music and art, talked about favorite artists, art, and \"how the power of music connects us all\" — \"It was such an inspiring conversation - I feel like I'm on a creative high.\" — and shared a photo of the two of them sitting on a bench in the snow (Calvin's side in the Music section of /memories/calvin.md); Dave: \"That's amazing, Calvin! Music really does bring people together and foster creativity. Glad to hear you had such an inspiring conversation!\" and shared his new vintage camera that he bought this month (November 2023) (a photo of a camera sitting on a table next to a plant) — \"which takes awesome photos!\" (details in ## Photography) [S30T4][S30T5]. Calvin: \"Hey Dave, music really brings people together, huh? Do you use this camera for photos? They always turn out so good!\"; Dave: yes — \"this camera is very good, it helps me capture those special moments really clearly\" [S30T6][S30T7]. Calvin: \"Having a good camera is key for capturing those special moments.\" and asked what Dave likes to take photos of (Calvin's message closed with a photo of a sunset with a wave crashing on rocks) [S30T8]. The chat then continued: Dave answered — he loves capturing the beauty of nature (sunsets, beaches, waves) and shared a sunset/wave pic; the two agreed nature's beauty conveys emotion and can boost our spirits in tough times (Dave shared a waterfall pic he snapped the previous week at a nearby park — Calvin: \"Can't wait to check it out myself sometime\" — and Calvin closed that part of the exchange with a pic he shot in a Japanese garden, a bench under a tree with pink flowers) (details in ## Photography and ## Parks; Calvin's side in the Photography, Music, and Relationships sections of /memories/calvin.md) [S30T9][S30T10][S30T11][S30T12][S30T13][S30T14][S30T15][S30T16]. The chat then continued: Dave: \"Cool, Calvin! Found an even better spot, with a bench under a tree with pink flowers - so peaceful. A perfect spot to relax and take in the beauty.\" (he describes the same bench-under-a-pink-flower-tree scene Calvin just photographed as \"a spot\" he found; details in ## Photography); Calvin: \"That sounds great, Dave! Can't wait to see it.\" [S30T17][S30T18]. Dave: \"Check it out, Calvin. It's really calming, I think you'll like it. We will definitely go there!\" — and asked whether there was anything else Calvin would like to share [S30T19]. Calvin: yes — a few more great news: he's accepted an invitation to perform at an upcoming show in Boston — \"It's going to be an unforgettable musical experience!\" — and he'll fill Dave in on all the details later (details in the Music section of this file and in ## Music of /memories/calvin.md); Dave: \"Wow, Calvin! That's amazing news! Congratulations on both the gala attendance and the upcoming performance. I can't wait to hear all about it and maybe even catch one of your shows in Boston. Let me know when you're free to catch up. Cheers to your musical journey!\" [S30T20][S30T21]. Calvin: \"Thanks, Dave! I'll catch you when I'm in Boston. Cheers!\" — and the chat closed with goodbyes — Dave: \"Looking forward to seeing you. Stay safe, talk to you soon!\" and Calvin: \"Thanks! You too. Talk to you later!\" [S30T22][S30T23][S30T24].","text_sha256":"40360785e469ea9e172000cb0b26725cc55503077d150932c8e19d9ee992e1ec","timestamp":"2023-11-17T10:54:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D30:1"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":157,"line_start":157,"source_locators":["[S30T1]"],"text_sha256":"c0276aee65470bbc39dad5021c211e729734ea923bb48f43298f2e0b3ba5e082"},{"dia_ids":["D30:3","D30:5","D30:6","D30:7","D30:8","D30:9"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":158,"line_start":158,"source_locators":["[S30T3]","[S30T5]","[S30T6]","[S30T7]","[S30T8]","[S30T9]"],"text_sha256":"855eb0e8293f3665e289a1621ccb758391e667a04aa82d2cb6dde5ba753cce1f"}],"dia_ids":["D30:1","D30:3","D30:5","D30:6","D30:7","D30:8","D30:9"],"evidence_id":"ev-b0a78aa510364c7c30dca9f21310109ce08c19494650d04920709f853f8bdf14","group_id":"/memories/dave.md > # Dave","line_end":158,"lin